OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with some showery rain.
OL,7,FBecoming drier in the early hours with
OL,8,Fa few clear periods. Strong southerly
OL,9,Fwinds veering southwesterly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,12,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,13,Fa few showers. Strong south to
OL,14,Fsouthwest winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FTuesday, mainly cloudy with rain or
OL,18,Fshowers, Orkney windy, drier in
OL,19,Fevening. Wednesday and Thursday mainly
OL,20,Fdry and bright with the odd shower,
OL,21,Fperhaps some rain Thursday evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
